# Env files: .env.firebase.production (prod), .env.firebase.staging (staging)
# Staging notes:
# - ENVIRONMENT=staging
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://staging.pax-vault.f3nation.com
# - OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=pax-vault-staging (separate OAuth client)
# - OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=https://staging.pax-vault.f3nation.com/api/auth/callback
# - BQ vars are shared with prod (same dataset)
# - Push with: npm run firebase:env:staging
